olor: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica situado o centro do evento e secretariado?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Todo o secretariado, concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partidas, chegadas e banhos situam-se no <strong>Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo da Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O evento conta com o <strong>Trail Ultra (50 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Longo (31 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Curto (15 km)<\/strong>, <strong>Trail Experience (10 km)<\/strong> e <strong>Caminhada (10 km)<\/strong>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar copo ou reservat\u00f3rio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">Sim, por pol\u00edtica eco-respons\u00e1vel n\u00e3o s\u00e3o disponibilizados copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma <a href=\"https:\/\/acorrer.pt\/eventos\/12-trail-montes-saloios\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">ACorrer<\/a>.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Trail Montes Saloios 2027\", \"startDate\": \"2027-02-21\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo de Covas de Ferro, Almargem do Bispo, Sintra, Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Sintra\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Moto Clube TT Montes Saloios e Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quando e onde se realiza o Trail Montes Saloios 2027?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento realiza-se no domingo, 21 de Fevereiro de 2027 , em Covas de Ferro (Almargem do Bispo, Sintra).\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica situado o centro do evento e secretariado?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Todo o secretariado, concentra\u00e7\u00e3o, partidas, chegadas e banhos situam-se no Pavilh\u00e3o Gimnodesportivo da Liga dos Amigos de Covas de Ferro .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Quais s\u00e3o as dist\u00e2ncias dispon\u00edveis?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O evento conta com o Trail Ultra (50 km) , Trail Longo (31 km) , Trail Curto (15 km) , Trail Experience (10 km) e Caminhada (10 km) .\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"\u00c9 obrigat\u00f3rio levar copo ou reservat\u00f3rio de hidrata\u00e7\u00e3o?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"Sim, por pol\u00edtica eco-respons\u00e1vel n\u00e3o s\u00e3o disponibilizados copos descart\u00e1veis nos postos de abastecimento.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde posso realizar a inscri\u00e7\u00e3o oficial?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"As inscri\u00e7\u00f5es realizam-se online na plataforma ACorrer .\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":66331,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[672,22,497,498,499],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-44122","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-covas-de-ferro-sintra","event_type-caminhada","event_type-trail","event_type-trail-curto","event_type-trail-longo","event_type-trail-ultra","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/trail-montes-saloios-2027.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/44122","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href"